==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|Al Madinah}} {{i|for the city in Saudi Arabia}}

===Etymology===
* The city in Saudi Arabia is derived from {{bor|en|ar|اَلْمَدِينَة||the city}}. {{root|en|ar|م د ن}}
* The river and former borough on the [[Isle of Wight]] are derived from {{inh|en|ang|Meðune||the middle one}}.
* The river and county in [[Texas]] are derived from the {{bor|en|es|-}} surname {{m|es|Medina}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/məˈdinə/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-Medina.ogg|Audio (US)}}

